WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.051 --> 00:00:13.430
I always just did whatever I wanted.

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:16.725
Because I was young and I didn't care.

00:00:16.725 --> 00:00:18.810
You're going to have to promise me something.

00:00:19.436 --> 00:00:20.103
What?

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:22.939
That you won’t call the cops.

00:00:27.777 --> 00:00:29.988
Um, hello. Ms. Carlile?

00:00:29.988 --> 00:00:31.614
Mrs. 

00:00:31.614 --> 00:00:32.782
Ben Saunders.

00:00:32.782 --> 00:00:34.367
Gardener extraordinaire.

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:35.160
Ready to get started. 

00:00:42.584 --> 00:00:43.710
Hey, Ben.

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:45.754
Something I can do for you, Mrs. Carlile?

00:00:46.921 --> 00:00:47.547
Thank you. 

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:50.383
Hey, you know how you could really really thank me?

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:51.968
Mind if I jump in the pool?

00:00:51.968 --> 00:00:52.927
Are you a swimmer? 

00:00:52.927 --> 00:00:54.095
Never really get the chance...

00:00:54.095 --> 00:00:54.971
...but I'm pretty good...

00:00:54.971 --> 00:00:56.848
...at most physical stuff. 

00:00:58.558 --> 00:01:00.518
She’s a little out of your league don’t you think?

00:01:00.852 --> 00:01:01.770
Here’s some advice.

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:03.021
All things in this world...

00:01:03.021 --> 00:01:04.481
...are divided into groups. 

00:01:04.481 --> 00:01:07.484
Do not mix your groups.

00:01:09.152 --> 00:01:10.445
Look, I don't have anything.

00:01:10.445 --> 00:01:12.155
And I see your house and your car. 

00:01:12.155 --> 00:01:13.323
You have all these beautiful things...

00:01:13.323 --> 00:01:14.616
...and they aren’t being taken care of. 

00:01:14.908 --> 00:01:16.201
You have no idea what it means...

00:01:16.201 --> 00:01:19.329
...to a guy like me to take a dip into a private pool.

00:01:19.537 --> 00:01:21.790
I’m in love with you.

00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:24.793
It's all a game. 

00:01:24.793 --> 00:01:25.794
The whole world. 

00:01:27.170 --> 00:01:28.671
I'd like to report an illegal alien...

00:01:28.671 --> 00:01:29.506
...in my neighborhood.

00:01:30.423 --> 00:01:31.883
Only suckers choose not to play it.

00:01:41.017 --> 00:01:42.185
You like her.

00:01:42.185 --> 00:01:43.603
You want her.

00:01:43.978 --> 00:01:45.021
You want me to cut her?

00:01:45.021 --> 00:01:46.397
Until she bleeds all over?

00:01:46.898 --> 00:01:49.025
She makes no difference to me.

00:01:58.785 --> 00:02:00.912
It wants something that doesn’t belong to it.

00:02:00.912 --> 00:02:01.746
What?

00:02:01.746 --> 00:02:02.288
You. 

00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:07.335
Kinda overstayed my welcome.

00:02:07.335 --> 00:02:08.545
Maybe you should go.

00:02:08.545 --> 00:02:10.130
Do you want me to?

